<title>USA: Paracelsian Inc extends common warrants.</title>
<headline>Paracelsian Inc extends common warrants.</headline>
<dateline>ITHACA, N.Y. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paracelsian Inc said on Thursday it extended its common stock warrants through September 6, 1998.</p>
<p>The warrants, which were scheduled to expire on September 6, 1997, entitle each holder to buy one common share at $3.25. The company can redeem the warrants if the stock price exceeds $4.75 for 15 consecutive days.</p>
<p>Paracelsian shares closed Thursday at 1-3/8, up 1/8 for the day.</p>
<p>Paracelsian is a biotechnology company that seeks to develop useful products from herbal sources.</p>
</text>
